["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Podcast: Kimi K3.1 Pro, the new cyber reality, and Muse musings astroturfing abliterated model B300 / NVL72 PHP2Shell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-interconnects-php漏洞公开后无人作恶-网络安全瓶颈不是ai而是没人打补丁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c99c5f34972836e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>PHP漏洞公开后无人作恶：网络安全瓶颈不是AI而是没人打补丁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi主动压低自身攻击能力以示负责；PHP高危漏洞曝光后预期的大规模黑客利用并未出现——瓶颈是企业几年不打补丁，而非AI能力强弱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Startup Playbook | Box CEO Aaron Levie context rot spec-driven development sub agent TAM go-to-market PLG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-a16z-创业公司能跑赢大公司-不是因为技术-而是组织换不动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>创业公司能跑赢大公司，不是因为技术，而是组织换不动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大公司人多但流程早已固化、改不动，创业公司没有历史包袱，能立刻把agent接进工作流——这是AI第一次让以小博大在经济上真正可行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业方法论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1369: Florida Model Makes Measles Great Again VHIT (vaccine-induced herd immunity threshold) vaccination reproduction number (R_v) HLA class I CTL epitope founder effect escape mutation / epitope variant\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-twiv-佛州还没取消疫苗强制令-麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>佛州还没取消疫苗强制令，麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">佛州儿童疫苗接种率只有91.6%,已经低于阻断麻疹所需阈值；取消强制令后接种率或跌到82%,麻疹将在十年内变成持续50年的地方病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Syria: Cradle of Cities Amorite Hurrian cuneiform vassal king Mitanni\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-25-ancients-叙利亚不是帝国争霸的过道-而是人类最早和平条约的诞生地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/443cfc236f2ce59c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>叙利亚不是帝国争霸的过道，而是人类最早和平条约的诞生地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公元前2300年埃卜拉与邻国签下的条约里，连「信使等超过十天要管饭」这种细节都写明了——外交规则那时就已成熟，叙利亚是规则的发明者，不是夹缝中的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代近东</span><span class=\"tag\">外交史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Eleanor of Aquitaine | Extra History Complete | European History Angevin Empire The Anarchy devil&#x27;s brood\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-extracredits-埃莉诺煽动儿子叛乱是传说-史料显示她当时根本不在场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b240ed2c2cbee729-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">35:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>埃莉诺煽动儿子叛乱是传说：史料显示她当时根本不在场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果埃莉诺真的在幕后操纵儿子叛乱，亨利大概率会直接休了她、把她关得更惨——她更像是宫廷方便甩锅的替罪羊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪史</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Dead Printers Tell No Tales PKI Root of Trust (ROT) HSM M-of-N key splitting tamper-evident packaging Secure Boot / Verified Boot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-oxideandfriend-防拆袋没拆对-oxide-连夜重做整套根密钥签发仪式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09bb50f19f9b4357-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>防拆袋没拆对，Oxide 连夜重做整套根密钥签发仪式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Oxide 工程师开车回家路上越想越不安，调头回公司亲手测试防拆袋，发现自己能神不知鬼不觉地重新封口，于是带着仪式团队连夜把整套根密钥签发流程重做了一遍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">PKI</span><span class=\"tag\">信任根</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: William Palmer strychnine antimony coroner&#x27;s inquest apoplexy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-stuffmissed-尸体里验不出毒药-陪审团却只花75分钟判他绞刑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>尸体里验不出毒药，陪审团却只花75分钟判他绞刑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">连环投保受益人接连死亡、尸检程序混乱、尸体里验不出番木鳖碱——陪审团仍只凭动机和巧合给Palmer定了死罪，这案子至今仍有人质疑是冤案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人寿保险欺诈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Clean Neurons, Black October, the GPU Credit Crunch, and Buying the Supply Chain cognitive core Harberger tax polysemanticity bitter lesson adversarial diffusion take-or-pay contract\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-cogrev-创业ai实验室真正缺的不是gpu-而是信用评级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b361faf0df2675a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>创业AI实验室真正缺的不是GPU，而是信用评级</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放贷人收回一台超算后根本不知道它值多少钱，于是新实验室只能靠预付全款换长约——这才是算力扩张的真正瓶颈，不是芯片或电力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力信用</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链瓶颈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Malcolm Gaskill on Why Our Ancestors Weren&#x27;t as Superstitious as We Think pareidolia confessional state\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-goodfight-两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起-启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起，启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真实的猎巫审判记录显示，十六至十七世纪欧洲审判约十一万起，陪审团常以证据不足拒绝定罪——这幅画面远比「集体疯狂」复杂，也远比后世想象的温和。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">猎巫审判</span><span class=\"tag\">启蒙运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What It Takes to Win as a Founder | Ben Horowitz GPT wrapper RDBMS solopreneur LAMP stack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-a16z-被骂-gpt套壳-不是坏事-当年sap也被当成数据库套壳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">41:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>被骂「GPT套壳」不是坏事：当年SAP也被当成数据库套壳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说「GPT套壳」搞错了重点：关系型数据库刚出现时SAP也被嘲笑是数据库套壳，真正的护城河是模型之上的专有数据，以及比对手好十倍的产品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span><span class=\"tag\">护城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a Chicago Restaurant Has Stayed Open For Nearly Three Decades farm-to-table ghost kitchen shared kitchen prix fixe GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-oddlots-独立高端餐厅行业-整体回报率是负的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>独立高端餐厅行业，整体回报率是负的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开了近30年高端餐厅的老板说，独立餐饮没有护城河、谁都能抄配方，守法经营还要比同行多付5%到10%成本，行业整体回报因此是负的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span><span class=\"tag\">小生意经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1368: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin SSPE (Subacute Sclerosing Panencephalitis) adaptive randomized trial screwworm post-exposure prophylaxis (PEP)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-24-twiv-停打新生儿乙肝疫苗-20岁慢性感染数从232暴涨到47万/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>停打新生儿乙肝疫苗，20岁慢性感染数从232暴涨到47万</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国卫生部长RFK推动用自愿接种代替新生儿乙肝普种，模型显示这会让20岁时慢性感染数从232例暴涨到47万例。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">埃博拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Cyber Panic, Ken Griffin&#x27;s Bubble Warning, The Fall of France? PHP to shell virtual patch bond vigilantes Obliteration AI chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-allin-ai支出的90-来自1-的公司-八成是亏损的创业公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9af963e06c2ea01b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI支出的90%来自1%的公司，八成是亏损的创业公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">钱从VC流向创业公司，创业公司把钱花在AI上做出营收，再回头找VC加轮融资——这是闭环，不是真实扩散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Embracing the Bond Market: Masters in Business with Robin Wigglesworth Consols Sukuk Securitization Bearer bond CBO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-mastersinbiz-ai-泡沫本身不可怕-可怕的是它越来越靠发债撑着/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI 泡沫本身不可怕，可怕的是它越来越靠发债撑着</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">历史数据显示，由股权推动的泡沫破裂后经济影响有限，由信贷推动的泡沫破裂才真正伤筋动骨，而今年AI超大厂商发债规模已从2000亿美元跳到5000亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">债券市场</span><span class=\"tag\">美国国债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"This Is How You Should Actually Make Launch Videos hook demo-driven development\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-ycsp-300万播放不算成功-留存100人才算他决定all-in/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/34375bce7f138269-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">47:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>300万播放不算成功，留存100人才算他决定All in</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hey Clicky创始人说，让他决定全职做这款产品的不是300万次播放，而是7000次下载后仍有约100人连续五天在用——留存数据，而非播放量，才是他判断一个产品该不该继续做的依据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">短视频营销</span><span class=\"tag\">产品发布</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI越强大，人为什么越累｜钦文对话马兆远 Testing Knowledge\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-效率翻倍后是早下班还是裁员加班-决定了技术会不会让人更累/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fc78e021049c424-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>效率翻倍后是早下班还是裁员加班，决定了技术会不会让人更累</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗素百年前问过同一个问题：工厂效率提高一倍后，是分享给工人更多休息，还是裁掉一半人、逼剩下的人加班自保，AI不过是这道选择题的最新版本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">教育改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Tom Milton on how we could verify a US–China deal on AI zero-knowledge proof flexHEG FPGA side channel OPCW national technical means\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-eightythousand-能验证美中ai协议的技术-全球只有约50人在做/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f395fcfe057f7280-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>能验证美中AI协议的技术，全球只有约50人在做</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美中若想就AI减速达成协议，核心难题是互信；验证技术就是把这种互信工程化成可检查的证据——但目前全球做这件事的工程师，用个位数的团队规模就能数完。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">算力验证</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Amazon CEO Andy Jassy on the $220 Billion AI Buildout barbell (demand) stateful runtime environment Nitro Annapurna Labs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-a16z-220亿美元砸下去-亚马逊ceo说2027年算力照样卖光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>220亿美元砸下去，亚马逊CEO说2027年算力照样卖光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">杰西说即使今年砸220亿美元资本开支，亚马逊依然主动留下一部分需求没满足——2026年容量已卖光，2027年大部分卖光，2028年也卖掉一大块，这笔钱花得值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">资本开支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Democratizing Security for the Agentic Web with Cloudflare CTO Dane Knecht CVE WebPKI Zero Trust AEO X402 CPM/CTM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-nopriors-cdn巨头cto预言-未来18个月一半工程时间要用来补漏洞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/44db1fd0a7b5258a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">41:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>CDN巨头CTO预言：未来18个月一半工程时间要用来补漏洞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">漏洞披露速度从一年一次变成每周多次，连TLS信任根密钥都曾被人用种子数字4破解——CTO说未来18个月，一半工程资源要砸向安全。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Netflix Angst, The End of the Internet, Q&amp;A on Meta’s VR Glasses, Anthropic Alignment, You Can See Everything elliptical curve cryptography zero trust generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-sharptech-广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户-订阅模式做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户，订阅模式做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">广告定价能随算法变准持续上涨、不影响用户留存；订阅涨价一旦引发流失就晚了——这正是奈飞参与度下滑、广告营收目标又没达标时真正该慌的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奈飞</span><span class=\"tag\">广告变现</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Forgotten Godmother of Economic Literature Edgeworth box marginalists labor theory of value DSGE racked rent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-oddlots-比简-奥斯汀还畅销的她-因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>比简·奥斯汀还畅销的她，因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的小说比《国富论》原著好读得多，却因为教育意味太浓，在简·奥斯汀式自然主义叙事兴起后被读者和经济学史一起抛弃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">经济思想史</span><span class=\"tag\">女性经济学家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"反地产逻辑，为什么成就了阿那亚｜钦文对话马寅\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路-不是战略远见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f06d53df338a0f19-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">28:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路，不是战略远见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马寅说如果2012年还能像别的开发商一样快进快出赚快钱，他绝不会死磕阿那亚——是十亿贷款和只剩这一个项目的绝境，逼出了这套反地产逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长期主义</span><span class=\"tag\">社区运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"重新定义个人电脑，老黄到底凭什么？RTX Spark深度解析 PRISM MXC Windows on ARM PAIR Prefill/Decode MOE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-23-laoshi-rtx-spark芯片没变-英伟达要的不是性能而是pc定义权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">老</div><span class=\"dur\">24:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>RTX Spark芯片没变，英伟达要的不是性能而是PC定义权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这颗芯片几乎就是去年发布的DGX Spark换了操作系统，老黄真正想要的不是跑分赢家，而是把CPU、GPU、内存、系统捆成一套只认英伟达规则的PC新架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Compute Comes in Rectangles — Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO BYOC Neoclouds spot capacity FDE MFU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-gpu-稀缺的真正病根-算力只能整块按三年期打包购买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7cf8550aeeab084a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>GPU 稀缺的真正病根：算力只能整块按三年期打包购买</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说，GPU 短缺最大的问题不是抢不到卡，而是几乎所有产能都打包成三到六个月后交付的三年期合约出售，这和大多数客户真实的忽高忽低的需求完全对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力采购</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU稀缺</span>\n</div></div></a>"]